{"time": 1757908444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1880383920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“还好我手残，不玩空洞”"}
{"time": 1757908480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787143299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#下一条"}
{"time": 1757908634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670985727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“要不要试一下昨天泡的冰滴？用了两款瑰夏拼凑制作的？”熟悉的声音从你前面传来"}
{"time": 1757908717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663171730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“why not？你知道的，我一直喜欢新奇的东西”"}
{"time": 1757908822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63254869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“冰滴的话会比平常你喝的咖啡更浓郁一点，苦味不会这么明显，回甘也很不错”老板从冰柜中拿出分享壶，给你倒了一杯"}
{"time": 1757909029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791640897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“就像滴去杂质的冰呢”"}
{"time": 1757909190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1514260577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“并不完全如此，苦对咖啡而言也是必要的，可以对咖啡的风味和层次感都有所关联”"}
{"time": 1757909348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789941678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“所以比起去杂，更像是萃取吗？”"}
{"time": 1757909360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377971389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“咖啡的精华都被浓缩了”"}
{"time": 1757909477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2103711354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯，你是大学生嘛，原理简单来说就是在冰水里面萃取，不同成分的萃取率和高温高压的咖啡机中是不一样的，所以咖啡风味也大有不同”"}
{"time": 1757909523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792233009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“开始期待了呢”"}
{"time": 1757909633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464130171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "他从冰柜中拿出分享壶，往杯子倒了些咖啡，再加上几颗冰块保存风味，递了给你"}
{"time": 1757909700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673343330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#品尝一口冰滴的咖啡"}
{"time": 1757910139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299428663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "刚入嘴不同于美式的醇厚气息从你嘴中散发，本就寒冷的天气配上冰块的低温刺激你的神经，一个激灵和那一刻的头痛洗去了昨晚通宵研究硬件的疲惫。然后是把酸感包裹得恰到好处的浆果香味，苦味确实稀少许多。咽下以后，能感受到少许的甘味在舌间逗留。"}
{"time": 1757910428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966469702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（其实不喜欢喝美式，酸得没边）"}
{"time": 1757910435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046880816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（只能喝拿铁）"}
{"time": 1757910466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119900857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（美式不酸吧，主要是苦）"}
{"time": 1757910466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515933068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（可以接受苦，不能接受酸）"}
{"time": 1757910477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688497258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1119900857]（确实）"}
{"time": 1757910477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409632583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（那你更不能喝手冲了，会更酸）"}
{"time": 1757910495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358403690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（反正味道太强烈的不行）"}
{"time": 1757910497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262765050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（拿铁的牛奶会中和掉咖啡的味道，也能改善口感）"}
{"time": 1757910506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138249940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（那冰滴不太行）"}
