{"time": 1757912023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529163394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“有意思，感觉会是绝佳的课题材料”"}
{"time": 1757912057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614559788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#拿出手机拍张照，记下联系方式，然后登录博物馆官网进行核实"}
{"time": 1757912076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799894205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#稍后再通过联系方式接触工作人员"}
{"time": 1757912094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587822920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#不过在这之前，得先吃点小熊曲奇饼干"}
{"time": 1757912265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598779441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1614559788]官网确实刊登了这种信息，一如既往没什么浏览量"}
{"time": 1757912319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2097317820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“看来是真的，嘿嘿，事件，我来了”"}
{"time": 1757912345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704278247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#拿着饼干盒，前往黑背街221b“"}
{"time": 1757912475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538158171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "踏着细雪来到侦探博物馆，这里依旧熙攘，但你能督到角落的有个展柜拉起了黄黑色的警戒线，里面空无一物"}
{"time": 1757912566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621616986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=753277599]#用之前的联系方式，试图与委托人沟通"}
{"time": 1757912643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226447411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“喂？”一个女声从电话传来"}
{"time": 1757912697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357604502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”您好，请问是侦探博物馆的工作人员吗？我想接受这个失窃委托“"}
{"time": 1757912767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321884121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“真的吗，那太好了。我是这里的管理员，名叫朱蒂·康伯巴奇”"}
{"time": 1757913022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408353103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”你好，可以称呼我菲莉汐娅，是一名业余侦探。不知道能否让我了解一下案情？“"}
{"time": 1757913280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748103771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“菲莉汐娅小姐您好，在这之前我想问一句，这个博物馆蕴含的故事，您觉得是虚幻的还是真实的？”"}
{"time": 1757913458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901684396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”故事就如同历史，如果你认为它是真的，那么它就不会假“"}
{"time": 1757913467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506605059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（先睡一会儿）"}
{"time": 1757913620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509271997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（ok）"}
{"time": 1757913624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "200699538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": ".log off"}
{"time": 1757916907, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1210092092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1757917215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133222005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“其实并非‘认为’，经过我的研究，这个故事其实就是真实的。因为是故事，所以一个不起眼的藏品在现在临近圣诞节愈发猖狂的犯罪率中无人问津。”"}
{"time": 1757917318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "829262716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#没有作答，对管理员的说辞不置可否"}
{"time": 1757917330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031806004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“昨天晚上博物馆这件藏品失窃，警察无心处理这件案件，唯一的线索指向了阿卡姆了，我现在已经动身前往了。”"}
{"time": 1757917445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265659149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“可能说起来你不会相信，这件物品曾在瑞士的莱辛巴赫瀑布夺下，并经由柯南道尔带回贝克街221B收藏。这件物品极其危险，也许和最终犯罪有关。”"}
{"time": 1757917466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707265696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“如果这是真的，我担心玛雅文明所谓世界毁灭的语言将会成真”"}
{"time": 1757917507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756277197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”关于案件的资料可以发给我吗？我想知道前因后果“"}
{"time": 1757917512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058232336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”我会出属于个人的一份力“"}
{"time": 1757917558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125625988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#虽然并不相信这位管理员狂热的说辞，但是一码归一码，案件本身还是很吸引人的"}
{"time": 1757917721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109238266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“谢谢您的理解和帮忙，请允许我说声抱歉，案件的具体内容我希望线下再谈。如果您愿意帮忙，我可以报销您的行程和吃住，找回失物后也会给予您一笔不菲的报酬。”"}
{"time": 1757917750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825428887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "心里暗道：公费旅游，倒也不错"}
{"time": 1757917838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548928371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”好的，什么时候出发？“"}
{"time": 1757918043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181543253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“我已经启程了，大概明天中午到阿卡姆市，到时候我们那边见吧。如果担心的话可以告诉我卡号，先给您一部分作为定金”"}
{"time": 1757918112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138970633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（还有这种好事）"}
{"time": 1757918121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840579087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#高兴地报上id"}
{"time": 1757918165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "293949138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（答案是第一个导入一时兴起了，导致后面不打就不对了）"}
{"time": 1757918176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583505274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "很快，你收到了一笔定金"}
{"time": 1757918305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1785498160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”好好好，我马上就来“"}
{"time": 1757918336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699757340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“谢谢您，我们到时再见”"}
{"time": 1757918348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287341369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嘟....”对方挂了电话"}
{"time": 1757918428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742557050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#好，开始查看车票，买最早那班"}
{"time": 1757918609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533655594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "距离圣诞节还有一段距离，虽然时间紧迫但空余的车票也并不少。"}
{"time": 1757918628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189060807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（在出发前，还有什么要准备或者调查的吗）"}
{"time": 1757918696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1353251456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（没什么了吧）"}
{"time": 1757918706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239392257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（非专业人士，不需要准备那么多）"}
{"time": 1757918720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103015617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#到宿舍收拾下行李，拿点日用品"}
{"time": 1757918728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813261083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#顺便把笔记本拿上"}
{"time": 1757918731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526457949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（那你出发就导入结束了）"}
{"time": 1757918752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467905203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（那么，什么时候开正式团呢）"}
{"time": 1757918811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33953233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（等en导入结束的话，明天开）"}
{"time": 1757918826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314388912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（善）"}
{"time": 1757918835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434687440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（那今天先把作业做了）"}
{"time": 1757918842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "928579352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（明天课还挺满）"}
{"time": 1757918881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022512028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（那不是正好）"}
{"time": 1757918923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881965714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（那不是正好）"}
{"time": 1757918971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403524014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=813261083]那么，菲莉汐娅坐上了去途的列车，走进了扑朔迷离的未来。"}
{"time": 1757918975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422188909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043679506", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": ".log end"}
